{"server":"tw","storyId":"act32side_level_act32side_03_beg","groupId":"act32side","stageId":"act32side_03","title":"假面舞池","storyCode":"CR-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ebcf2de95830ce571fca2fafa0e75f99cf86b64e26311d19601bacc86d8ec5f1","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告，藥已經在地下庫房裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和您指示的一樣，我們學著那些人安置了炸彈，製造了一點混亂，就搶到手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您怎麼看著愁眉不展的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想這批藥該怎麼脫手……就算改變包裝銷往地下市場，也很難不留下蹤跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是怕有人查？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……行動開展時我收到一封訊息，羅德島這次前來派送藥物的人身分有些特殊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，我們行動時留意到了，那個男的是個熟面孔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可老潘喬現在人在監獄裡，手下的人走的走，散的散。他兒子如今回到這裡，未必還能像從前那樣吃得開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不一定，市政府之前有人透給我了些訊息，說坎黛拉在考慮培養自己的接班人，那小子正是幾個考察對象之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是老潘喬和坎黛拉不是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，坎黛拉用人可一向不避親仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們該怎辦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，上次雷內爾的小秘書來時和我們分享了一些資源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是……有幾家店鋪和倉庫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其中是不是有一家藥廠的倉庫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藥品嘛，多一車少一車，大概他們也不會太在乎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶隊的軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是，把麻煩丟給雷內爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話可不能這麼講，他們主動找上門合作，我們回些謝禮不也正常？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"久等了，埃內斯托先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有沒有，我也是剛剛才來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，麻煩給我一杯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經為你點好了，布克先生，還是老樣子，雙倍濃縮，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"離開這裡這麼久，難為你還記得我的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這點時間，再久也久不過我們共事的時間嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩位的咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，嗯……不錯，什麼都是剛剛好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你走之後，再沒人能像你一樣做事面面俱到了，現在新來的年輕人啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等看吧，放在那個環境裡，人變得很快的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對了，坎黛拉女士託我把這份文件帶給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文件？坎黛拉女士有事情吩咐我去做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是你要的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……我今天才來找你，話還沒說出口呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"你一到多索雷斯，坎黛拉女士就知道消息了，又聽說你們運送的貨物遭人搶劫，肯定正著急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"文件袋裡是最近這些天物流與交通的異常數據，相關的地點與人員都有記錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士這樣掛心，我都不知道該如何感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市長保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，說什麼感激，只要你也能惦記著我們大家就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這地方灰比貨還多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ELA，你接到的到底是什麼任務？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倉庫的貨物買來之後就滯銷了，積壓在倉庫裡足足有半年，只剩一個管理員看守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不相當於敞開大門放任別人來拿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，米沃什說幾乎每天都會收到失竊報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是來追查丟失貨物去向的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這倉庫只出不進已經是常態了，但昨天倉庫看守人接到一通電話，說有一批藥品會運過來，要他做好交接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米沃什覺得很蹊蹺，讓我們過來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來者不善？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難說，這樣一間倉庫我看不出對方能有什麼圖謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許米沃什只是想找個藉口支開你和舒瑞，畢竟他好不容易空下來可以和雷內爾做點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他大可以直說，我絕對不會出現在他們一公里範圍內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出你真的看那傢伙不太順眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不想天天看那個傢伙大門不出在陽台打高爾夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少他遵守了對你的承諾——安分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那份文件沒有差錯，許多異常線索都匯集到了這裡，但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我們找到的地方看起來就是個廢棄的破倉庫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等等會有一批藥物運抵這間倉庫，等下看看是不是我們要找的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倉庫裡只有一個管理員，沒有什麼威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照出發之前定好的計劃，在卡車駛進倉庫後，已經潛入的特克諾會關閉監控，放我和你進入查看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還得再等等啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打哈欠）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倉庫管理員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——哈——睏死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倉庫管理員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"那些藥品到底什麼時候能送到啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倉庫管理員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"沒意思，上面居然還派人來查看，有什麼好看的。今天天氣這麼好，不如找塊沙灘曬曬太陽，喝杯咖啡，聽首歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倉庫管理員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"……在黑夜我與你跳起一曲無聲的探戈♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倉庫管理員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"光碟放在哪裡了，哦，找到了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳機裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在黑夜我與你跳起一曲無聲的探戈♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳機裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看不清你的面容，只有你手心的溫度♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倉庫管理員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……這才是生活嘛……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘖，這傢伙未免也太不專業了吧……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（既然這麼想躺下好好睡一覺，滿足你好了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倉庫管理員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，得來全不費工夫，讓我看看，監控在哪裡……找到了，在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不是說只有一個管理員，怎麼倉庫裡還有四個人？誰啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……二位，我已經破壞掉監控了，有一個好消息與一個壞消息，好消息是我現在能確定，那批藥物就是我們要找的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"壞消息是，雷內爾的保鏢也來了，四個人，全在倉庫裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"什麼？這地方平常不是根本沒人會來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"呃，讓我想想……我們人數不佔優勢。特克諾，你能斷掉照明供電嗎？我和阿萊塔或許可以偷偷摸黑突入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……我試試吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經斷掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"好，那我們也行動了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖……這傢伙還真是會享受，又是聽歌又是喝咖啡。這是用今年的新豆子泡的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還蠻香的咧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——！燙死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，全弄在鍵盤上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衛生紙在哪裡！得趕快擦乾淨啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然，一聲彈簧頂起塑膠殼的清脆響聲打斷了特克諾匆忙的動作。\n她趕忙抬起手臂，看見鍵盤旁有一盞小燈亮起了綠色的光，燈上還貼著一張小標籤，上面寫著——\n“廣播”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這車到底什麼時候到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我們時間還很充裕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也很正常，這種廢棄倉庫供電設施很容易出問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在黑夜我與你跳起一曲無聲的探戈♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看不清你的面容，只有你手心的溫度♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"FUZE，去控制室看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在一個黑漆漆的角落♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你明明踩到我的腳趾，但暈乎乎的卻是我的腦袋♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦……早知道就不喝他那杯破咖啡了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可惡，有人來了……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（得快點躲起來。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"管理員先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ELA，管理員被人打暈，監視和照明系統都有被破壞的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意警戒，有人潛入倉庫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只打翻了咖啡，還按錯了按鈕……是個很不專業的傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嘁……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會嘗試恢復照明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不行啊……估計埃內斯托他們還沒進來呢。只好麻煩你也睡一覺了，大塊頭。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這傢伙反應怎麼這麼快？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小孩子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"從黑暗角落中躥出的人讓FUZE很是震驚，不僅因為她嬌小的身形，更因為她揮向自己的拳頭，速度之快讓他只能勉強招架。\n幾個回合後，他抓住了女孩的手腕，試圖將她控制住。但馬上他就意識到，有些事情沒有他想的那麼輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想得美！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見鬼，這孩子的力氣比成人還要大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是什麼小孩子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩奮力掙開FUZE的控制，狠狠地踩在了他的腳趾上。\n還沒來得及感受來自腳尖的痛楚，女孩回身一記飛踢又狠狠衝向他的面門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"漫步在長長的街道，我們鬆開彼此的手♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就此分開，你的身影再難尋覓♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"徒留我一個人，在黑夜中無盡地摸索♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那無聲的，跳到一半的探戈♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）接下來跟好我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"貼著牆根，兩人悄無聲息地前行，絲毫沒有意識到就在不遠處，另外幾個人也正摸索著前行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）FUZE？！該死，他一直沒有回覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我們去支援他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）不，我去，你們留在這裡繼續等車來，潛入的人肯定不只一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）小心，如果有人潛伏在這裡，那緊急照明也不能使用，會讓我們變成活靶子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）你要用我的夜視儀嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）你留著吧，我會謹慎的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"握緊手中的槍，ELA伏低身體，努力在黑暗中辨識著方向。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（該死……阿萊塔到底去哪裡了？不是說讓她跟緊的嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸黑找路實在是太難了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是這裡嗎？感覺好像走錯了，按理說接下來應該不會有轉角。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無數次的擦肩，無數次的錯過♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（該死，怎麼有個轉角，不是這個方向！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無數次的尋覓，無數次的失落♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或許下個轉角我們還能再遇見♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA&龍舌蘭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（或許最好是什麼也別遇見。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）埃內斯托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟了，跟丟了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）這女孩難道沒發現自己來來回回繞著一堵牆在轉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）不是每個人都有夜視儀的。話說我好像在哪裡見過她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）是昨天那片社區裡的人……我們要把她丟在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我猜她的朋友會來找她，我在這裡等著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）好，我去別處看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呃……好重啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（早知道就該把你和那個倒楣蛋一起塞進櫃子裡的。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那個社區的人怎麼會找到這裡來，這下事情麻煩了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼聲音？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯……？）"},{"type":"narration","text":"摸向腰間的武器，DOC摒住呼吸，黑暗中人的聽覺變得異常敏銳，沉重的拖拽聲愈來愈近，愈來愈響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無數次的擦肩，無數次的錯過♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無數次的尋覓，無數次的失落♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喇叭裡的聲音","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許下個轉角我們還能再遇見♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾&DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾&DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人同時驚叫出聲之後，整間倉庫都熱鬧起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"DOC？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古斯塔夫？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撞在我手上算你倒楣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是法術閃光！快找掩體，ELA！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，等等，這房間經不起你這麼搞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，你的同伙在我手裡，勸你不要輕舉妄動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，阿萊塔在他們手裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，不巧，我們這邊也有你們的人質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是舒瑞！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑暗中，唯一的光源只有特克諾源石技藝發出的光芒，雖然不能照亮整間倉庫，但看清彼此的臉龐還是足夠的。\n所有人的視線不停轉移，交錯，擦過其餘人的臉龐，並且在上面讀到了一樣的情緒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我覺得有點尷尬……到底為什麼會陷入這樣的情景……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，或許我們可以交換人質，然後各走各的路？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾&ELA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們來這裡到底是要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查清楚是誰在用這間倉庫做交易，你又是來幹什麼，小朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到我們遺失的藥品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們早就說過，藥品不是我們搶走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？那你們為什麼在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，查清楚到底是誰在往這間倉庫送東西！你們又是抱著什麼目的來這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們說過了！我們丟的藥在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——真是和你們講不通！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"管理員在不在啊，貨到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，跑這一趟累死人了……這地方也太偏僻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個……我還有個提議，既然大家都想知道那批藥到底是怎麼回事，不如直接問問送藥來的人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
